Problem URL - 


Solution -

(SELECT DISTINCT s.product_id, p.product_name
FROM Sales s LEFT JOIN Product p ON
    s.product_id = p.product_id
WHERE s.sale_date >= '2019-01-01' AND
    s.sale_date >= '2019-03-31')
EXCEPT
(SELECT DISTINCT s.product_id, p.product_name
FROM Sales s LEFT JOIN Product p ON
    s.product_id = p.product_id
WHERE s.sale_date < '2019-01-01' OR   
    s.sale_date > '2019-03-31')